# Notebooks are first-class tracked artifacts here, so make them diffable/mergeable.
# nbdime ships in our deps; `./dev setup-git` wires it up as the notebook driver.
*.ipynb diff=jupyternotebook
*.ipynb merge=jupyternotebook

# Keep line endings sane across the team
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
